        <p class="section-tag">Founder</p>
        <h2 id="founder-heading">Ajeh Augustine Enenche</h2>
        <p class="founder-role">Founder &amp; CEO</p>
        <p>Founder of EKUM Electricals, driving reliable electrical solutions in Nigeria. Committed to quality, safety, and professional service delivery.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="feature-grid triple-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-number">01</div>
          <h3>Professional Workmanship</h3>
          <p>Precise execution and quality-focused standards on every project.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-number">02</div>
          <h3>Reliable Electrical Solutions</h3>
          <p>Systems designed to support long-term efficiency and performance.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-number">03</div>
          <h3>Transparent Communication</h3>
          <p>Clear guidance and updates to keep each project easy to follow.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
